  VALUES (252, 5, $p24_b_252$[{"t": "list", "id": "s1-4-2-b1", "imp": "core", "items": ["1、==开关分支== `switch`", "（1）==开关语句==", "（2）`switch` 语句是一种==多路判定语句（多分支选择）==，它测试表达式是否与若干整型常量值中的某一个匹配，并跳转到对应分支执行。", "（3）配合关键字：`case`、`break`、`default`。", "（4）`switch` 是另一种选择结构语句，常用来代替对同一个整型量进行等值判断的多分支 `if-else` 语句。", "2、`switch` ==语句结构=="], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"h": 263, "t": "img", "w": 964, "id": "s1-4-2-b2", "alt": "switch-case 多分支结构语法框架、case 常量与 default 默认分支说明图", "imp": "normal", "src": "/kb-assets/skill/p31_r1_2b237cb213e531eb.png", "title": "", "caption": "`switch` 语句标准多分支框架：`case` 常量标签、`break` 跳出与 `default` 兜底分支作用"}, {"t": "list", "id": "s1-4-2-b3", "imp": "core", "items": ["3、==考查点==：`case` ==执行流程==", "（1）==当== `switch` ==后面圆括号内表达式的值与某个== `case` ==后面的常量表达式值相等时，就从该== `case` ==入口开始顺序向下执行==。"], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"t": "code", "id": "s1-4-2-code-1", "imp": "normal", "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    char ch = 90;\n    switch (ch) {\n        default: printf(\"default\\n\"); break;\n        case 11: printf(\"11\\n\");\n        case 13: printf(\"13\\n\");\n        case 89: printf(\"89\\n\");\n        case 90: printf(\"90\\n\"); break;\n    }\n    return 0;\n}", "lang": "c", "title": "示例 1：匹配 case 90 后遇到 break 退出"}, {"h": 166, "t": "img", "w": 602, "id": "s1-4-2-b4", "alt": "char ch=90 匹配 case 90 后输出 90 的控制台运行结果截图", "imp": "normal", "src": "/kb-assets/skill/p31_r2_e274172989447381.png", "title": "", "caption": "验证示例：表达式 `ch=90` 跳过 `default` 直接命中 `case 90` 并输出 `90`"}, {"t": "list", "id": "s1-4-2-b5", "imp": "core", "items": ["（2）==若所有== `case` ==的常量表达式都未与== `switch` ==表达式匹配，则跳转到== `default` ==入口执行==（`default` ==位置任意，同样遵循是否带== `break` ==的穿透规则==）：", "①、`default` ==后面带== `break;`（==执行完== `default` ==立即退出== `switch`）"], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"t": "code", "id": "s1-4-2-code-2", "imp": "normal", "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    switch (99) {\n        default: printf(\"default\\n\"); break;\n        case 11: printf(\"11\\n\");\n        case 13: printf(\"13\\n\");\n        case 89: printf(\"89\\n\");\n        case 90: printf(\"90\\n\");\n    }\n    return 0;\n}", "lang": "c", "title": "示例 2：所有 case 均不匹配，进入 default 且有 break"}, {"h": 218, "t": "img", "w": 578, "id": "s1-4-2-b6", "alt": "switch(99) 无匹配 case 进入带 break 的 default 输出 default 的控制台截图", "imp": "normal", "src": "/kb-assets/skill/p32_r0_97bb3c4bfe671832.png", "title": "", "caption": "验证示例（1）：`switch(99)` 匹配不到 `case` 进入带 `break` 的 `default`，仅输出 `default` 后退出"}, {"t": "list", "id": "s1-4-2-b7", "imp": "core", "items": ["②、`default` ==后面不带== `break`（==会向后穿透执行紧随的== `case`）"], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"t": "code", "id": "s1-4-2-code-3", "imp": "normal", "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    switch (99) {\n        default: printf(\"default\\n\");\n        case 11: printf(\"11\\n\");\n        case 13: printf(\"13\\n\");\n        case 89: printf(\"89\\n\");\n        case 90: printf(\"90\\n\");\n    }\n    return 0;\n}", "lang": "c", "title": "示例 3：default 无 break 时向后穿透所有 case"}, {"h": 254, "t": "img", "w": 541, "id": "s1-4-2-b8", "alt": "default 无 break 导致穿透执行后续所有 case 并连续输出多行的控制台截图", "imp": "normal", "src": "/kb-assets/skill/p32_r1_bfa0adac474ff763.png", "title": "", "caption": "验证示例（2）：`default` 末尾缺省 `break`，发生穿透并顺序输出后续各 `case` 值"}, {"t": "list", "id": "s1-4-2-b9", "imp": "core", "items": ["（3）==命中某个== `case` ==但缺少== `break` ==时的各种穿透情况（核心规律：从匹配入口一直顺序执行到最近的== `break;` ==或整个== `switch` ==闭合大括号为止==）：", "①、==后续遇到其他带== `break` 的 `case` ==时，执行完该== `break` ==立即退出当前== `switch`"], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"t": "code", "id": "s1-4-2-code-4", "imp": "normal", "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    switch (11) {\n        case 11: printf(\"11\\n\");\n        case 13: printf(\"13\\n\"); break;\n        case 89: printf(\"89\\n\");\n        case 90: printf(\"90\\n\");\n        default: printf(\"default\\n\"); break;\n    }\n    return 0;\n}", "lang": "c", "title": "示例 4：case 11 无 break，穿透到 case 13 遇到 